  "id": "collateral-heredity",
  "term": "collateral heredity",
  "definition": "Collateral heredity is inheritance as estimated between relatives who are not in a direct parent-to-child line, such as brothers. In the source, it is treated as the degree to which a trait shown in one such relative is expected to appear in another.",
